        "text": "Web 3 is envisioned to allow users to move to decentralized platforms with greater control of their personal data, enjoy greater privacy, and be rewarded for the data or content that they choose to share. Users can interact, exchange information, and conduct peer to peer financial transactions, becoming content owners instead of just content users. Non fungible tokens or NFTs are thought to be an early version of a technology that lets users become owners of their data and creations. Blockchain will also enable permission digital identities with the usage of crypto wallets, leading to more inclusive and equitable digital economies. Another essential feature of Web3 is what's called the Semantic Web, which means computers can understand and use information just as humans can.",
